<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/msa@/~part_VI__cl_19__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Menteri boleh, melalui perintah yang disiarkan dalam Warta, meminda Jadual. Pendakwaan"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/msa@/~part_VI__cl_20> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/msa@/~part_VI> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/msa@> .
